NAME
    gcloud dataplex context - manage Dataplex Context

SYNOPSIS
    gcloud dataplex context COMMAND [GCLOUD_WIDE_FLAG ...]

DESCRIPTION
    Manage Dataplex Context.

GCLOUD WIDE FLAGS
    These flags are available to all commands: --help.

    Run $ gcloud help for details.

COMMANDS
    COMMAND is one of the following:

     lookup
        Looks up LLM context for data assets.

NOTES
    This variant is also available:

        $ gcloud alpha dataplex context

